 "name": "VAOPGCPREC 23-97, Jul 1, 1997, Multiple Ratings for Knee Disability",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center\">\tDecision Assessment Document<br />\tVAOPGCPREC 23-97, Jul 1, 1997, Multiple Ratings for Knee Disability<br />\tOffice of General Counsel Precedent Opinion</p><p>\t<br />\t<strong>What the case is about</strong></p><p>\tWhere a claimant has arthritis and instability of the knee, does 38 C.F.R. \u00a7 4.71a authorize multiple ratings under diagnostic codes 5003 and 5257?</p><p>\t<strong>Impact on VBA</strong></p><p>\tA claimant who has arthritis and instability of the knee may be rated separately under diagnostic codes 5003 and 5257.</p><p>\t<strong>Summary on facts and findings</strong></p><p>\tSee OGC Precedent Opinion</p><p>\t<strong>References</strong></p><p>\t<a href=\"http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1997/Prc23-97.doc\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1997/Prc23-97.doc</a><br />\t&nbsp;</p>",
